# Fetched by `vale sync`; not vendored. Run `vale sync` after cloning.
/.vale/styles/Google

# Written by `insta` when an inline snapshot fails locally, and consumed
# by `cargo insta review`; it's scratch state for that one run, not
# something to commit. CI never produces one — INSTA_UPDATE=no in
# .github/workflows/ci.yml stops insta writing pending snapshots there.
*.pending-snap
